  "description": "This package is intended for Visual Studio Web Site projects deployed as Azure App Service. For information about the difference between web application projects vs. Web Site projects, see: https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dd547590(v=vs.110).aspx\n\nWith AppDynamics for Windows Azure App Service users can now:\n   - Monitor the health of their Windows Azure App Service\n   - Troubleshoot performance problems in real time\n   - Rapidly diagnose root cause of performance problems\n   - Dynamically scale up and scale down their Windows Azure App Service applications and Web Site projects based on performance metrics",
